  "$extras": "Rooms a house gets besides bedrooms, a kitchen, bathrooms and a living room. Rooms measure at most their `maxSide` (short and long side), so a house with more floor than its rooms may take gets extras, in this order, each if `chance` (per lot size) says so and the floor still has room to spare: upstairs in a two-storey house with `floor: \"upper\"`, families only with `minBedrooms`. Floor left over after that makes the house smaller. `label` names the room in the house's description.",
